{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Audit Phase 3C 路线图 P1 #11：PT (Parallel Tempering) multi-temperature parallel scheduling，claim \"exploration diversity at zero added cost\"。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n终末地工业规划器 70×70 网格 266 设施 exact LBBD 求解器。Master 是 CP-SAT。当前 parallel 配置：`--parallel-processes 4` 启 4 个独立 worker process，各自跑 master+benders 循环，candidate 级并行。CP-SAT 内部默认 8 num_search_workers（可用 EXACT_CP_SAT_WORKERS env 改 4，per P0 #2 RSS 节省）。\n\nPT (Parallel Tempering) 来自 SA / 物理模拟 —— 多个温度同时跑、相互交换状态。在 SAT/CP-SAT 上 \"PT\" 通常指：portfolio worker 各自用不同 random_seed / 不同 search-strategy，相互交换 incumbent / cut pool。\n\n## 原始 claim\n\n- 路线图 (`/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/phase3c_optimization_roadmap_v1.md`) 第 65 行：\n  > | 11 | **PT multi-temperature parallel scheduling** | R10 `a2d29f537e2b0ba30` | exploration diversity at zero added cost | ~1 day | ~10× |\n- 来源 transcript: `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a2d29f537e2b0ba30.output`\n\n## Audit 任务（按顺序）\n\n1. **Read R10 transcript** (`a2d29f537e2b0ba30.output`) 找 #11 PT 的具体定义：在 CP-SAT 上 \"PT\" 是什么操作？多温度 = 多 random_seed？多 search_strategy？多 linearization_level？\n\n2. **CP-SAT 原生支持**：用 WebSearch 查 OR-Tools `sat_parameters.proto` 有没有原生 PT support。grep 关键词：`tempering`, `temperature`, `simulated_annealing`, `parallel` （ortools/sat/sat_parameters.proto on GitHub）。如果原生没有，靠什么实现？\n\n3. **\"zero added cost\" 核实** —— 这是 claim 里最可疑的话：\n   - 如果 PT 通过外部多 worker 实现，worker 数固定 (4 process × 8 thread = 32 thread)，加 PT = **必然挤占其他 subsolver 时间** → 不是 zero cost\n   - 如果通过 CP-SAT 内部 random_seed portfolio 实现，已经是 default 行为（默认 8 worker 各自 seed 不同）→ 加 PT 等于\"已经在做\"\n   - 是否需要额外 inter-process communication（exchange state）→ IPC 开销\n   - 内存：多温度可能多个 model copy → 内存翻倍\n\n4. **跟 P1 #11 的 P0 #2 (4 worker RSS profile) 兼容性**：\n   - P0 #2 已经决定用 4 worker 限制 RSS。PT 加进来还能保持 RSS 限制吗？\n   - 如果 PT 要求 N worker portfolio diversity，跟 4 worker 限制冲突\n\n5. **跟项目 P1 #11 stage 1 已落地**：\n   - commit `d07e303` \"P1 #11 PT stage 1: per-process random_seed env override on master CpSolver\"\n   - 已经在做\"每个 process 自己的 random_seed\"——这是不是 PT stage 1？还是另一回事？\n   - 跟 R10 transcript 里 #11 PT 的设想对得上吗？\n\n6. **真实 stage 2+ 工作量 + ROI**：基于上面的发现，剩余 stage 真实做什么、增量 ROI 多少。\n\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文 OK）\n\n```\n## 1. R10 transcript \"PT\" 具体定义\n[transcript 原话 + 多温度具体什么参数变化]\n\n## 2. CP-SAT 原生支持\n[sat_parameters.proto 相关参数 + URL]\n\n## 3. \"zero added cost\" 核实\n[四种实现方式各自的真实 cost 估]\n\n## 4. 跟 P0 #2 4-worker 限制兼容性\n[冲突或不冲突 + 真实 RSS 影响]\n\n## 5. 跟已落地 stage 1 (d07e303) 对照\n[已做 = stage 1，剩 stage 2+ 是什么]\n\n## verdict\nGO / GO-WITH-CAVEATS / PARTIALLY_REFUTED / REFUTED\n\"zero cost\" 是否成立 + 修正后的真实 ROI\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- 必须 read R10 transcript\n- 必须 git log --grep \"P1 #11\" 对照 commit d07e303\n- 必须 WebFetch sat_parameters.proto 关键参数\n- 不要凭训练数据估\n- 保持简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"15927b3c-f9f0-407e-a73f-462534a61c6f","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:07.788Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"15927b3c-f9f0-407e-a73f-462534a61c6f","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_delta","addedNames":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"addedLines":["CronCreate","CronDelete","CronList","EnterWorktree","ExitWorktree","Monitor","NotebookEdit","PushNotification","RemoteTrigger","TaskCreate","TaskGet","TaskList","TaskStop","TaskUpdate","WebFetch","WebSearch"],"removedNames":[],"readdedNames":[]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"9e04ac65-ab0a-4d61-a441-e41b6b6ed8a3","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:07.791Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9e04ac65-ab0a-4d61-a441-e41b6b6ed8a3","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- update-config: Use this skill to configure the Claude Code harness via settings.json. Automated behaviors (\"from now on when X\", \"each time X\", \"whenever X\", \"before/after X\") require hooks configured in settings.json - the harness executes these, not Claude, so memory/preferences cannot fulfill them. Also use for: permissions (\"allow X\", \"add permission\", \"move permission to\"), env vars (\"set X=Y\"), hook troubleshooting, or any changes to settings.json/settings.local.json files. Examples: \"allow npm commands\", \"add bq permission to global settings\", \"move permission to user settings\", \"set DEBUG=true\", \"when claude stops show X\". For simple settings like theme/model, suggest the /config command.\n- keybindings-help: Use when the user wants to customize keyboard shortcuts, rebind keys, add chord bindings, or modify ~/.claude/keybindings.json. Examples: \"rebind ctrl+s\", \"add a chord shortcut\", \"change the submit key\", \"customize keybindings\".\n- simplify: Review changed code for reuse, quality, and efficiency, then fix any issues found.\n- fewer-permission-prompts: Scan your transcripts for common read-only Bash and MCP tool calls, then add a prioritized allowlist to project .claude/settings.json to reduce permission prompts.\n- loop: Run a prompt or slash command on a recurring interval (e.g. /loop 5m /foo). Omit the interval to let the model self-pace. - When the user wants to set up a recurring task, poll for status, or run something repeatedly on an interval (e.g. \"check the deploy every 5 minutes\", \"keep running /babysit-prs\"). Do NOT invoke for one-off tasks.\n- schedule: Create, update, list, or run scheduled remote agents (routines) that execute on a cron schedule. - When the user wants to schedule a recurring remote agent, set up automated tasks, create a cron job for Claude Code, or manage their scheduled agents/routines. Also use when the user wants a one-time scheduled run (\"run this once at 3pm\", \"remind me to check X tomorrow\").\n- claude-api: Build, debug, and optimize Claude API / Anthropic SDK apps. Apps built with this skill should include prompt caching. Also handles migrating existing Claude API code between Claude model versions (4.5 → 4.6, 4.6 → 4.7, retired-model replacements).\nTRIGGER when: code imports `anthropic`/`@anthropic-ai/sdk`; user asks for the Claude API, Anthropic SDK, or Managed Agents; user adds/modifies/tunes a Claude feature (caching, thinking, compaction, tool use, batch, files, citations, memory) or model (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in a file; questions about prompt caching / cache hit rate in an Anthropic SDK project.\nSKIP: file imports `openai`/other-provider SDK, filename like `*-openai.py`/`*-generic.py`, provider-neutral code, general programming/ML.\n- init: Initialize a new CLAUDE.md file with codebase documentation\n- review: Review a pull request\n- security-review: Complete a security review of the pending changes on the current branch","skillCount":10,"isInitial":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1dca89ee-cdf7-4584-9ca2-a5586e236bd3","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:07.792Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
