l_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CaoyRNWweHqvYNwk2NMt3\",\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"9c119089-0446-47e1-9b33-c7edffb9a4f1\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:10:21.304Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n14:14:{\"parentUuid\":\"9c119089-0446-47e1-9b33-c7edffb9a4f1\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"ac68b9dc-9847-4e6f-8ec2-6b4367414408\",\"agentId\":\"a2d29f537e2b0ba30\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_015Ew5GMaQAL4rT5RzPEEh77\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"Web search results for query: \\\"parallel tempering replica exchange combinatorial optimization 2025\\\"\\n\\nLinks: [{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Parallel tempering - Wikipedia\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parallel_tempering\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"A Permutational Boltzmann Machine with Parallel Tempering for Solving Combinatorial Optimization Problems | Springer Nature Link\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-58112-1_22\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"IsingFormer: Augmenting Parallel Tempering With Learned Proposals\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://arxiv.org/html/2509.23043v1\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"[2509.23043] IsingFormer: Augmenting Parallel Tempering With Learned Proposals\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.23043\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"IsingFormer: Augmenting Parallel Tempering with Learned Proposals | OpenReview\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=yQuTa0yukr\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Two-dimensional Parallel Tempering for Constrained Optimization\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://arxiv.org/html/2506.14781v2\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Design of proteins by parallel tempering in the sequence space - PubMed\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/40990840/\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Generalised Parallel Tempering: Flexible Replica Exchange via Flows and Diffusions\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://arxiv.org/html/2502.10328v1\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Decentralized Replica Exchange Parallel Tempering: An Efficient Implementation of Parallel Tempering Using MPI and SPRNG | Springer Nature Link\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-540-74484-9_44\\\"},{\\\"title\\\":\\\"Parallel tempering–inspired distributed binary optimization with in-memory computing | Request PDF\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/389872012_Parallel_tempering-inspired_distributed_binary_optimization_with_in-memory_computing\\\"}]\\n\\nI've completed the web search on \\\"parallel tempering replica exchange combinatorial optimization 2025\\\". Here are the key findings:\\n\\n## Overview\\n\\nParallel tempering (also known as replica exchange MCMC sampling), is a simulation method aimed at improving the dynamic properties of Monte Carlo method simulations of physical systems, and of Markov chain Monte Carlo (MCMC) sampling methods more generally.\\n\\n## Recent 2025 Developments\\n\\nSeveral notable 2025 advancements have emerged:\\n\\n**IsingFormer (September 2025):** A Transformer trained on equilibrium samples that can generate entire spin configurations resembling those from the target distribution. These uncorrelated samples are used as proposals for global moves within a Metropolis step in PT, complementing the usual single-spin flips. On 3D spin glasses (optimization), PT enhanced with IsingFormer finds substantially lower-energy states, demonstrating how global moves accelerate search in rugged landscapes.\\n\\n**Two-Dimensional Parallel Tempering (2D-PT):** A method that extends PT to a second dimension with multiple energy landscapes to accelerate sampling under constraints.\\n\\n**Generalized Parallel Tempering (February 2025):** A mathematically formalized framework that combines the benefits of neural samplers with the robustness of PT, termed Generalised Parallel Tempering (GePT).\\n\\n**Protein Design Applications (2025):** Parallel tempering is shown to be a viable alternative to Monte Carlo sampling without replica exchanges and simulated annealing or related energy-based protein design methods.\\n\\n## Combinatorial Optimization Applications\\n\\nA Permutational Boltzmann Machine with Parallel Tempering is capable of solving NP-Hard problems such as QAP in excess of 100× faster than other state-of-the-art solvers.\\n\\n\\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.\"}]},\"uuid\":\"a25f70eb-2149-4177-a3fb-53622db337f8\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:10:29.869Z\",\"sourceToolAssistantUUID\":\"9c119089-0446-47e1-9b33-c7edffb9a4f1\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n21:21:{\"parentUuid\":\"564c5c06-a401-4290-a886-d1189f1632ea\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a2d29f537e2b0ba30\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-7\",\"id\":\"msg_01RTcn4vN8iyNfcZP6vvUZqx\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I have enough material. Let me synthesize into the requested ≤800-word brief.\\n\\n---\\n\\n# MCMC / CEM / SMC / 并行回火 调研简报（2024-2026）\\n\\n## 1. MCMC for Combinatorial Sampling\\n\\n**主线进展是 gradient-based discrete MCMC**——传统 MCMC 在离散组合空间靠局部翻转，混合慢；2023 之后的新一代利用目标函数对离散变量的\\\"伪梯度\\\"（Gibbs-with-Gradients、Discrete Langevin、iSCO）做并行化提议。\\n\\n代表工作：\\n- **Sun et al., ICML 2023, \\\"Revisiting Sampling for Combinatorial Optimization\\\"**：表明现代 MCMC 在 MaxCut/MIS/SAT 上能跟 SOTA 启发式打平。\\n- **iSCO (Discrete Langevin)**：在多个 CO benchmark 上 SOTA。\\n- **Reheated Gradient-based Discrete Sampling (arXiv 2503.04047, 2025)**：发现\\\"wandering in contours\\\"问题（在等高线上瞎逛），引入\\\"reheat\\\"机制突破。\\n- **Regularized Langevin Dynamics (arXiv 2502.00277, 2025)**：连续松弛 + 正则化，把 CO 变成可微分采样。\\n\\n对 SAT/CSP：hybrid MCMC（SAT 求解器做 proposal + Metropolis 单变量翻转修正）能保证 stationary 分布正确，2024-2025 在 SAT-sampling for statistical testing 上有应用。\\n\\n## 2. Cross-Entropy Method (CEM)\\n\\nRubinstein 1997 起源的方法，2024-2026 没有重大原创性突破，但**作为子模块嵌入 neural CO** 很常见：\\n- **CEM 训练 NCO (Neural CO) 模型**：每 epoch 采样 N 个解，取精英分位数 (top-ρ%) 当伪标签自模仿。这就是\\\"sample without replacement, but improvement\\\"那条线（arXiv 2403.15180）。\\n- **CEM-RL (ICLR 2019, 至今活跃)**：CEM 演化 + TD3 梯度，在 policy search 上一致优于纯 evolutionary 或纯 RL。\\n- 局限：**样本量需求大**，real-time planning 不友好（Pinneri et al. 已论证）。\\n\\n## 3. Sequential Monte Carlo (SMC) for Optimization\\n\\n- **Duan (2019) SMC for CO**：把 CO 目标视作非归一化概率密度 π(x) ∝ exp(βf(x))，β 渐进升温（density-tempering），粒子群带权重重采样。**有收敛证明**，不是元启发式。\\n- 2024-2025 主要应用在 **POMDP policy optimization**（SPO, arXiv 2402.07963 / 2505.16732），不是直接 CO。\\n- **SMC-SA**（Zhou & Chen）：把模拟退火嵌进 SMC 框架，温度调度更鲁棒。\\n\\nSMC 跟 CEM 区别：CEM 显式拟合参数族（如 Bernoulli 边缘），SMC 用粒子近似分布，不假设参数族。\\n\\n## 4. Replica Exchange / Parallel Tempering (PT)\\n\\n**这块 2025 最热**，值得重点关注：\\n- **IsingFormer (arXiv 2509.23043, 2025)**：Transformer 学习目标分布，生成\\\"全局 proposal\\\"插入 PT 的 Metropolis 步。在 3D spin glass（NP-hard）上找到显著更低的能量。\\n- **2D Parallel Tempering (arXiv 2506.14781, 2025)**：除温度维外加约束维，**专门处理硬约束**。\\n- **Generalised Parallel Tempering / GePT (arXiv 2502.10328, 2025)**：把 normalizing flow / diffusion 当 replica 之间的 transport，跨能量壁垒更高效。\\n- **Permutational Boltzmann Machine + PT**：在 QAP 上比 SOTA 快 100×。\\n\\n## 5. SAT/CSP/Placement 应用现状\\n\\n- SAT：hybrid MCMC（SAT proposal + 单翻转）已是主流采样路径\\n- QAP（二次分配，跟 placement 同构）：PT-based Boltzmann machine 显著领先\\n- Placement：直接把 CO 写成 Ising/QUBO，PT 或 discrete Langevin 求解\\n- 但**多数工作在无 hard constraint 或软约束场景**，对 CP-SAT 风格的硬约束 + 硬可行性证明不友好\\n\\n## 6. 跟 RL / GP / LLM evolution 对比\\n\\n| 方法 | 探索强度 | 样本效率 | 硬约束友好 | 收敛证明 | 2025 热度 |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| CEM | 中 | 低 | 弱 | 启发式 | 平 |\\n| Discrete MCMC (iSCO) | 高 | 中 | 弱（需软化） | 渐近 | 高 |\\n| SMC | 高 | 中 | 中 | 有 | 中 |\\n| Parallel Tempering | 高 | 中-高 | 中 | 渐近 | **很高** |\\n| RL (PPO/POMO) | 中 | 中 | 中 | 无 | 高 |\\n| GP / 演化 | 中 | 低 | 弱 | 无 | 平 |\\n| LLM evolution (FunSearch/AlphaEvolve) | 高（语义层） | 极低 | 强（生成代码可带约束） | 无 | 极高 |\\n\\n关键洞察：**MCMC/CEM/SMC 这一系跟你的设定有 mismatch**——它们假设可以频繁评估 f(x) 的\\\"软\\\"近似，而你的 candidate 评估是黑盒的\\\"完整 Benders 跑一遍\\\"，单次评估就要数秒到数分钟。\\n\\n## 是否值得用作 candidate ordering\\n\\n**部分有用，但不直接拿现成的 CEM/MCMC 来做 ordering，而是借鉴其思想**：\\n\\n**有价值的迁移**：\\n1. **CEM 的精英参数族更新思路**：把 candidate 的离散特征（如 ghost rectangle 位置/形状/朝向）维护一组 Bernoulli/Categorical 边缘分布，每 wave 用 top-ρ% 解过的 candidate 更新边缘。比单纯的 banditscore-greedy 多一层概率正则化，**抗噪声更好**——你的 UNKNOWN/UNPROVEN 标签本身就是噪声。\\n2. **Parallel Tempering 的多温度并行**：你已经有 `--parallel-processes 4` 多进程，**让不同进程跑不同\\\"温度\\\"**（即不同 ordering 探索强度：贪心 / 中度随机 / 高度随机），周期性交换\\\"成功 candidate\\\"。零成本扩展，2025 PT 在硬约束下证明有效。\\n3. **SMC 的 density tempering**：β 从小到大渐进收紧——实践对应 wave 早期允许低分 candidate，后期收敛到高分。比固定阈值更鲁棒。\\n\\n**不建议直接套**：\\n- 纯 CEM 需大样本，你的 wave 预算太小\\n- iSCO/discrete Langevin 需要 f(x) 可微近似，你没有\\n- IsingFormer 那种学习 proposal 的，得自建 Transformer + 你的数据规模也不够（266 实例）\\n\\n**结论：值得，但作为\\\"候选排序的概率包装层 + 多温度并行调度\\\"思路借鉴，不作为独立 lane。可以并入 Lane B（deterministic tuning）的子模块或 Lane C（AI sidecar）的 hint 生成器，AI Safety Contract 友好（order_only / hint-only，不写 checkpoint）。优先级中等，低于 PT-启发的多温度并行调度（这个几乎零成本就能上）。**\\n\\nSources:\\n- [Revisiting Sampling for Combinatorial Optimization (Sun et al., ICML 2023)](https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/sun23c.html)\\n- [Reheated Gradient-based Discrete Sampling for CO (2025)](https://arxiv.org/html/2503.04047)\\n- [Regularized Langevin Dynamics for CO (2025)](https://arxiv.org/html/2502.00277)\\n- [IsingFormer: PT with Learned Proposals (2025)](https://arxiv.org/html/2509.23043v1)\\n- [Two-dimensional Parallel Tempering for Constrained Optimization (2025)](https://arxiv.org/html/2506.14781v2)\\n- [Generalised Parallel Tempering via Flows and Diffusions (2025)](https://arxiv.org/html/2502.10328v1)\\n- [Self-Improvement for Neural CO (CEM-style, 2024)](https://arxiv.org/html/2403.15180v1)\\n- [SMC for Policy Optimisation in POMDPs (2025)](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.16732)\\n- [Sequential Monte Carlo Optimization and Statistical Inference (Duan, 2023)](https://wires.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/wics.1598)\\n- [CEM-RL (ICLR 2019, baseline)](https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.01222)\\n- [Cross-Entropy Method (Rubinstein & Kroese, foundational)](https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4757-4321-0)\\n- [Permutational Boltzmann Machine with PT for QAP](https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-58112-1_22)\"}],\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1423,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":3201,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":26739,\"output_tokens\":3377,\"server_tool_use\":{\"web_search_requests\":0,\"web_fetch_requests\":0},\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":3201},\"inference_geo\":\"\",\"iterations\":[{\"input_tokens\":1423,\"output_tokens\":3377,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":26739,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":3201,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":3201,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"type\":\"message\"}],\"speed\":\"standard\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CaoyTHXcVtoJZqgPhLESP\",\"attributionAgent\":\"general-purpose\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"96688f15-887e-4237-9888-41facea2daea\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-07T22:11:44.612Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\.upstream_clones\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d719d124-db59-4c64-86cf-96cb12125ad4","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:26.284Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e3d3cfb5-1567-4f40-bd7b-39d57fdce86f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
