{"parentUuid":"5c743f95-a28b-4096-aac7-3c95bec75f0d","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KzCtt9p3gJuXMj9YMJ2eXp","type":"tool_result","content":"commit d07e303c9d3af525a77ed2ff67117f8c3a6eb122\nAuthor: zhuran24 <99780881+zhuran24@users.noreply.github.com>\nDate:   Fri May 8 10:25:57 2026 +0800\n\n    P1 #11 PT stage 1: per-process random_seed env override on master CpSolver\n    \n    R10 audit a2d29f537e2b0ba30 recommended Parallel-Tempering style\n    multi-process portfolio: invoke 4 processes with different\n    random_seed values so each spawns a diverse CP-SAT search trajectory.\n    Stage 1 adds the env hook on master_model — when\n    EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED is set, it overrides the default\n    solver.parameters.random_seed (CP-SAT default = 1, identical across\n    processes).\n    \n    Default behavior unchanged: env unset → solver uses CP-SAT default\n    seed → same as today.\n    \n    Stages 2+: exact_parallel_scheduler.py worker dispatch needs to set\n    EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED differently per dispatch_seq before invoking\n    the worker. Deferred to a follow-up commit (cleaner to land scheduler\n    side separately for review purposes).\n    \n    Verified:\n    - master + exact_contract: 302 passed\n    - full pytest: 2033 passed, 0 failed (60 skipped)\n    - self-review: PROJECT_LOCK Forbidden Changes 5 conditions clear\n      (random_seed only changes search trajectory, not feasible-solution\n      set, certified_exact soundness preserved)\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\ndiff --git a/src/models/master_model.py b/src/models/master_model.py\nindex e2b6fef..3d9174a 100644\n--- a/src/models/master_model.py\n+++ b/src/models/master_model.py\n@@ -11108,6 +11108,16 @@ class MasterPlacementModel:\n         # Phase 3C P0 #4 #8 (env-gated): stronger no_overlap_2d propagation.\n         # Default off; A/B benchmark via env to validate cost/benefit.\n         apply_master_cp_sat_strong_disjunctive_propagation(solver)\n+        # Phase 3C P1 #11 (PT-style portfolio): allow per-process random_seed\n+        # override so multi-process invocation can spawn parallel-tempering\n+        # diverse search trajectories. Default falls back to CP-SAT default\n+        # (1) when env not set. R10 a2d29f537e2b0ba30 audit recommendation.\n+        seed_env = os.environ.get(\"EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED\")\n+        if seed_env:\n+            try:\n+                solver.parameters.random_seed = int(seed_env)\n+            except ValueError:\n+                pass\n         requested_search_branching = \"default\"","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8d3ff043-15aa-46a4-9685-ab61d6006291","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:27.045Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5c743f95-a28b-4096-aac7-3c95bec75f0d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
