{"parentUuid":"5e7d10c7-4232-4069-b7bd-5e87bc638094","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M3yz6Legsb34DFWNukiao9","type":"tool_result","content":"# SAT Solver Parameters: Random, Portfolio, and Search Strategy\n\n## Random Seed Parameters\n\n**random_seed**\n- Type: `int32`\n- Default: `1`\n- Description: \"At the beginning of each solve, the random number generator used in some part of the solver is reinitialized to this seed.\"\n\n**use_absl_random**\n- Type: `bool`\n- Default: `false`\n- Description: Controls whether to use ABSL's random number generation library.\n\n**permute_variable_randomly**\n- Type: `bool`\n- Default: `false`\n- Description: \"This is mainly here to test the solver variability.\"\n\n## Portfolio and Parallel Search\n\n**num_workers**\n- Type: `int32`\n- Default: `0`\n- Description: \"Specify the number of parallel workers (i.e. threads) to use during search.\" Zero means use all available cores.\n\n**num_search_workers** (deprecated)\n- Type: `int32`\n- Default: `0`\n- Description: Deprecated; use `num_workers` instead.\n\n**num_full_subsolvers**\n- Type: `int32`\n- Default: `0`\n- Description: \"Distinguishes subsolvers that consume a full thread from ones that are always interleaved.\"\n\n**subsolvers**\n- Type: `repeated string`\n- Description: Names of parameter sets used in multithread portfolio solving.\n\n**extra_subsolvers**\n- Type: `repeated string`\n- Description: \"Additional subsolver configurations added at the beginning of the list.\"\n\n**ignore_subsolvers** / **filter_subsolvers**\n- Type: `repeated string`\n- Description: Glob patterns to exclude or include specific subsolver types.\n\n## Search Branching Strategies\n\n**search_branching**\n- Type: `enum SearchBranching`\n- Default: `AUTOMATIC_SEARCH`\n- Options include:\n  - `AUTOMATIC_SEARCH`: SAT heuristics then fixed search\n  - `FIXED_SEARCH`: Fixed variable ordering\n  - `PORTFOLIO_SEARCH`: LNS worker portfolio\n  - `LP_SEARCH`: LP relaxation heuristics\n  - `PSEUDO_COST_SEARCH`: Historical objective change-based branching\n  - `PORTFOLIO_WITH_QUICK_RESTART_SEARCH`: Randomized with low conflicts\n  - `HINT_SEARCH`: Follow solution hints\n  - `PARTIAL_FIXED_SEARCH`: Fixed strategy with automatic completion\n  - `RANDOMIZED_SEARCH`: Entropy increase\n\n**randomize_search**\n- Type: `bool`\n- Default: `false`\n- Description: \"Randomize fixed search.\"\n\n**search_random_variable_pool_size**\n- Type: `int64`\n- Default: `0`\n- Description: \"Search randomization collects the top valued variables and picks one randomly.\""}]},"uuid":"99689c1b-dd51-4378-b7f1-4f07a63798f3","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:43.174Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5e7d10c7-4232-4069-b7bd-5e87bc638094","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
