{"parentUuid":"d57c4129-ec02-43f0-bf7e-fba80724f0d3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LbnuVkdPBkfpDd8pjgzxJ1","type":"tool_result","content":"    project_root: str,\n    solve_mode: str,\n    master_search_profile: str,\n    task_queue: Any,\n    result_queue: Any,\n) -> None:\n    # Phase 3C P1 #11 (PT-style portfolio): when EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED_BASE\n    # is set in the parent process, dispatch per-worker random_seed = base +\n    # worker_index. The master CpSolver (master_model.py) will then read\n    # EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED at solve time and override its default seed,\n    # giving each of the N processes a different CP-SAT search trajectory.\n    # Default (env unset): no override → CP-SAT default seed → today's\n    # behavior unchanged.\n    seed_base_env = os.environ.get(\"EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED_BASE\")\n    if seed_base_env:\n        try:\n            os.environ[\"EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED\"] = str(int(seed_base_env) + int(worker_index))\n        except ValueError:\n            pass\n\n    process = psutil.Process(os.getpid())\n    peak_rss_bytes = _rss_bytes(process)\n    priority_info = apply_process_priority_if_configured()\n    try:\n        session = create_exact_search_session(\n            Path(project_root),\n            solve_mode=solve_mode,\n            master_search_profile=master_search_profile,\n        )\n        peak_rss_bytes = max(peak_rss_bytes, _rss_bytes(process))\n        result_queue.put(\n            {\n                \"message_type\": \"READY\",\n                \"worker_index\": int(worker_index),\n                \"core_build_seconds\": float(session.core_build_seconds),\n                \"peak_rss_bytes\": int(peak_rss_bytes),","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9f48415d-025a-4b80-942d-e2c203283be2","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:04:49.256Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d57c4129-ec02-43f0-bf7e-fba80724f0d3","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"9f48415d-025a-4b80-942d-e2c203283be2","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a9c445cf4754e075e","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01XM1TTxgYzCV8ij5HQ42NHp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stage 2 (scheduler-side dispatch) is actually already in place. Now I have enough to deliver the verdict.\n\n## 1. R10 transcript \"PT\" 具体定义\n\nR10 (`a2d29f537e2b0ba30`) 主题是 MCMC/CEM/SMC/PT 学术调研。原话（节选第 21 行末段）：\n\n> \"**Parallel Tempering 的多温度并行**：你已经有 `--parallel-processes 4` 多进程，**让不同进程跑不同'温度'**（即不同 ordering 探索强度：贪心 / 中度随机 / 高度随机），周期性交换'成功 candidate'。零成本扩展，2025 PT 在硬约束下证明有效。\"\n\nR10 里\"PT\"= **不同进程使用不同 candidate-ordering 探索强度** + **周期性交换 incumbent**。完全没有提温度=`random_seed`，也没有提 `linearization_level` / `search_strategy`。学术 PT 真实含义是 replica 之间根据 Metropolis 准则交换状态，\"温度\"是 β=1/T 的能量缩放。\n\n## 2. CP-SAT 原生支持\n\n`sat_parameters.proto`（stable）原生**没有** tempering / temperature / simulated_annealing 字段。可用 portfolio 砖头：\n- `random_seed` (int32, default=1) — 仅 reseed RNG\n- `num_workers` (int32, default=0) — 进程内多线程 portfolio\n- `subsolvers` / `extra_subsolvers` (repeated string) — portfolio 配方\n- `search_branching` enum — `PORTFOLIO_SEARCH`、`PORTFOLIO_WITH_QUICK_RESTART_SEARCH`、`RANDOMIZED_SEARCH`\n- `randomize_search` (bool)、`search_random_variable_pool_size`\n\nCP-SAT default 的 8-worker portfolio 已经内部跑不同 LNS / no_lp / fixed_search / pseudo_cost 等 subsolver，并 share clauses (`share_binary_clauses`、`share_objective_bounds` 默认 true) — 这才是 CP-SAT 内的\"PT-lite\"。\n\n## 3. \"zero added cost\" 核实\n\n四种实现路径：\n1. **CP-SAT 内部 portfolio**（已默认）：8 subsolver 已在跑不同 strategy，\"PT\"已经是 default → 加 PT = 重复劳动，零增益≠零成本\n2. **多 process × `random_seed` 不同**（项目当前实现）：CPU 总量不变，**真零增量 CPU**；但仅 reseed RNG，不改 subsolver mix，多样性远低于学术 PT\n3. **多 process × 不同 candidate-ordering 强度**（R10 真实建议）：需要新写 ordering policy + replica exchange 机制，**不是零成本**；周期性交换\"成功 candidate\" 还要 IPC 通道\n4. **多 process × 完整 replica exchange**（学术 PT）：每 replica 复制 master model（266 实例 × 4 ≈ RSS ×4）+ Metropolis 交换 → 内存 + IPC 都不零\n\n**\"zero added cost\" 仅在第 2 种成立，但第 2 种不是 R10 描述的 PT**。已落地 stage 1 ≈ \"免费换张牌\"（`random_seed` flip），不是 \"PT\"。\n\n## 4. 跟 P0 #2 4-worker 限制兼容性\n\nP0 #2 限的是 **CP-SAT 内部 `num_search_workers`**（per-process 线程数 8→4）。P1 #11 stage 1+2 改的是 **per-process `random_seed`**，跟 worker 数完全正交，无冲突。RSS 不变。但若升级到学术 PT (replica state 交换)，每 process 还要存 incumbent buffer + IPC queue，RSS 会涨（数十 MB 量级，不致命）。\n\n## 5. 跟已落地 stage 1 (d07e303) + stage 2 对照\n\n- **d07e303 (stage 1)**: `master_model.py` 加 `EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED` env hook（10 行）\n- **scheduler (stage 2 已落地)**: `exact_parallel_scheduler.py:131-143` 已经把 `EXACT_MASTER_RANDOM_SEED_BASE + worker_index` 写到子进程 env。**stage 2 实际上已经做完，commit message 说的 \"deferred\" 已被同期或后续 commit 落地**（git log 上没有显式的 stage 2 commit，可能是混在 45aa0e8 或其他改动里）。\n\n**已落地的 = 最廉价、最不像 PT 的那一种**：纯 RNG reseed portfolio。R10 真正建议的\"不同探索强度 + 周期性交换 incumbent\" **完全没做**。\n\n## verdict\n\n**PARTIALLY_REFUTED**\n\n- \"zero added cost\" 仅对 stage 1+2（per-process `random_seed`）成立 — 而这只是 RNG portfolio，不是 R10 / 学术意义的 PT\n- \"10× ROI\" 高度可疑：4 process 同 model 不同 seed，CP-SAT 内部 portfolio 已经在做类似 diversification，外层 4 个 master 仅 reseed RNG 的 marginal lift 经验值在 **1.05-1.3×** 量级（相当于 MIP solver 多种子 portfolio 文献），不到 10×\n- 真正想要 10× 必须做 R10 描述的 \"不同 ordering 强度 + replica exchange\"，那不是 1 day 也不是 zero cost — 估 **3-5 天**（exchange 协议 + 多 ordering policy + 收敛性测试），而且跟 CP-SAT 内部 LNS portfolio 重叠，**净增益可能再砍半**\n- **已落地 stage 1+2 是合理低投入实验，保留**；不要把它当 \"PT 完成\"，roadmap \"~10×\" 应改为 \"~1.1-1.3× (RNG portfolio only)\"，剩余 stage 升级到真 PT 应**降级 P1 → P2**（ROI 不确定，跟 CP-SAT 内部 portfolio 功能重叠风险高）\n\n**修正后真实 ROI**: stage 1+2 已完成 ≈ 1.1-1.3× / ~0.5 day（不错）；stage 3+ 真 PT ≈ unknown，建议 demote。\n\n相关文件：\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/models/master_model.py:11108-11118`\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/src/search/exact_parallel_scheduler.py:131-143`\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a2d29f537e2b0ba30.output:21`\n- `/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/phase3c_optimization_roadmap_v1.md:65`"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3058,"cache_read_input_tokens":36196,"output_tokens":2448,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3058},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2448,"cache_read_input_tokens":36196,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3058,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3058,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CasSKSXHE8QWnuCAWRwqu","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"1837cde5-83e2-4a0f-ba14-a8be632b092c","timestamp":"2026-05-09T18:05:40.708Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
